# DRAFT: copies the Stage 1 and Stage 2 CITATION.cff; the authors confirm the wording. repository-code and date-released are
# to be set when the repository is created and a release is made.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Homolog Exclusion Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A pipeline that removes candidate lineage-specific genes showing evidence of a
  known protein domain (InterProScan, RPS-BLAST against CDD) or a homolog outside
  the analysed clade (BLAST+, jackhmmer), and merges the results into a per-gene
  verdict. Stage 3 of the LINGUA comparative genomics framework, developed as part
  of dissertation work on the identification and evolutionary analysis of de novo
  genes (DNGs).
authors:
  - family-names: Owoyemi
    given-names: Adekola
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4251-5777"
    affiliation: "Protein Evolution Lab (Casola Lab), Texas A&M University"
  - name: "Protein Evolution Lab (Casola Lab), Texas A&M University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ludtson/homolog-exclusion-pipeline"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - comparative genomics
  - homology search
  - protein domains
  - jackhmmer
  - de novo genes
  - bioinformatics pipeline
